{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは～"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "舞台 「鬼太郎誕生 ゲゲゲの謎」 初日に向けて\n今日も頑張ってます💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "緊張で 胃がキリキリしてます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗 https://video.unext.jp/freeword?query=%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E3%80%8C%E9%AC%BC%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%20%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%81%AE%E8%AC%8E%E3%80%8D"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初日から配信があるので是非！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ド緊張してる未来が既に見えています、、笑\n一生懸命頑張ります、、！！😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "年末年始 バタバタでなかなか載せれてなかった\nので、、！⬇️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobQ9dx7j.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なおが撮ってくれたお気に入りすぎる写真📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobP233VS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobevBf0Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ沢山あるので\nトークやインスタの方でも載せていきますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1月1日は 数時間だけ実家に帰ることができて！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "従姉妹や親戚の子達に久しぶりに会えて\n楽しい時間を過ごしてました🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobeW1jwQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1年ぶりに会ったら\n身長が伸びてて、\nおしゃべりも出来るようになってきて、\n成長の早さにびっくりします😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "姫奈のこと何回か名前で呼んでくれて嬉しかった🤦‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mob4jgjih.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またゆっくり 会えますように👶🏻‪‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それじゃあ！\n明日の本番に向けて もう少し頑張ってきます！"}], "source": "official"}